    {
      "id": "file:src/main.cpp",
      "type": "file",
      "name": "main.cpp",
      "filePath": "src/main.cpp",
      "summary": "程序入口。包含查找表正确性验证、棋盘操作单元测试、完整移动逻辑测试和 AI 基准测试（多局自动对弈统计）。",
      "tags": ["entry-point", "test", "benchmark", "game-loop"],
      "complexity": "moderate",
      "languageNotes": "使用 C++17 结构化绑定和 std::chrono 高精度计时。main() 先运行三组单元测试，全部通过后执行 AI 自动对局基准。"
    },
    {
      "id": "file:src/ai.cpp",
      "type": "file",
      "name": "ai.cpp",
      "filePath": "src/ai.cpp",
      "summary": "Expectimax AI 引擎实现。包含自适应搜索深度、CHANCE 节点（随机方块期望值）和 MAX 节点（玩家最优选择）的递归搜索，以及 Transposition Table 缓存和概率裁剪优化。",
      "tags": ["ai", "expectimax", "search", "optimization", "core"],
      "complexity": "complex",
      "languageNotes": "递归搜索函数之间形成 CHANCE↔MAX 交替调用。score_chance_node 展开所有空格的 90%/10% 放置概率，score_move_node 对四方向取最大值。"
    },
    {
      "id": "file:src/tables.cpp",
      "type": "file",
      "name": "tables.cpp",
      "filePath": "src/tables.cpp",
      "summary": "预计算查找表初始化实现。在程序启动时一次性填充所有 65536 种行状态的左移结果、右移结果、合并得分和启发式评估值。包含行移动模拟算法（压缩→合并→编码）和五维启发式评估函数。",
      "tags": ["lookup-table", "precomputation", "heuristic", "initialization", "core"],
      "complexity": "complex",
      "languageNotes": "init_tables() 分两遍完成：Pass 1 填充 move_left_table/score_table/heur_table，Pass 2 利用 reverse_row 推导 move_right_table。compute_row_heuristic 综合空格奖励、单调性、平滑度、合并潜力和位置权重五个特征。"
    },
    {
      "id": "file:include/ai.h",
      "type": "file",
      "name": "ai.h",
      "filePath": "include/ai.h",
      "summary": "Expectimax AI 引擎头文件。定义 AIConfig（搜索参数）、AIStats（搜索统计）、CacheEntry（Transposition Table 条目）和 AIEngine 类接口。",
      "tags": ["ai", "interface", "header", "expectimax"],
      "complexity": "simple"
    },
    {
      "id": "file:include/board.h",
      "type": "file",
      "name": "board.h",
      "filePath": "include/board.h",
      "summary": "Bitboard 棋盘核心表示。将 4×4 棋盘编码为 64 位整数（每格 4 bit 存 log2 值），提供 get/set cell、行列提取、转置、空格计数、最大 tile、随机放置新方块和朴素 Game Over 检测等内联操作。",
      "tags": ["bitboard", "core", "data-structure", "board-ops", "header"],
      "complexity": "complex",
      "languageNotes": "所有函数均为 inline，board_t = uint64_t，row_t = uint16_t。位布局：row0 占 bits[63:48]，row3 占 bits[15:0]，每行内高 nybble 对应左列。"
    },
    {
      "id": "file:include/tables.h",
      "type": "file",
      "name": "tables.h",
      "filePath": "include/tables.h",
      "summary": "预计算查找表头文件。声明四张全局表（move_left/right、score、heuristic），并提供基于查表的高性能内联函数：四方向棋盘移动、统一移动接口、合并得分、Game Over 检测和启发式整板评估。",
      "tags": ["lookup-table", "move", "evaluation", "performance", "header", "core"],
      "complexity": "complex",
      "languageNotes": "board_move_up/down 通过 transpose→行操作→transpose 复用行查表。evaluate_board 对 4 行+4 列查 heur_table 求和实现 O(1) 评估。"
    },
